OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Navy's new attack submarine
OL,4,Aarrives at Faslane
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Navy's newest Astute-class
OL,7,Fnuclear-powered submarine has arrived
OL,8,Fat its home port in Scotland.
OL,10,FHMS Agamemnon will undergo sea trials
OL,11,Fand operational preparation after
OL,12,Freaching HM Naval Base Clyde at
OL,13,FFaslane.
OL,15,FThe hunter-killer vessel, the sixth in
OL,16,Fthe Navy's arsenal, is equipped with
OL,17,Ftomahawk land-attack missiles and
OL,18,Ftorpedoes capable of striking targets
OL,19,Fup to 30 miles away.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
