OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Navy's new attack submarine
OL,4,Aarrives at Faslane
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Navy's submarine rear admiral, Andy
OL,7,FPerks, described HMS Agamemnon's
OL,8,Farrival as a "significant milestone".
